# Avoid Opening or Activating Tabs

Source of truth: `AGENTS.md` ("Avoid Opening or Activating Tabs"). Summary:

- Avoid opening or activating tabs whenever possible; prefer service worker `fetch`, offscreen documents, and content scripts in user-opened pages.
- Do not change the URL of a tab the user opened.
- If unavoidable: inactive tab, closed when done, via `withBackgroundTab` in `chrome-extension/lib/tab-scraper-utils.js`. Never `active: true` for new work.
- Existing call sites are baselined in `harness/invariants.md` (I1).
